{
  "$schema": "https://raw.githubusercontent.com/eupassarin/SimpleSign/main/docs/schemas/playbook.schema.json",
  "schema": 2,
  "id": "indecopi-guia-v4",
  "title": "INDECOPI software accreditation (Guide v4.0)",
  "description": "The automated part of an INDECOPI (IOFE, Peru) accreditation of signing and verification software (Guía de Acreditación de Software v4.0, annex B): each step runs against the Sandbox with the IOFE policy, through the library and the CLI, cross-validated with EU DSS when one is connected. Tags name the items of annex B of the guide (F-n: section 4.2, signing by an automated agent; V-n: section 4.3, verification by automated agents; S-n: section 4.4, time-stamps) and a topic; docs/playbooks/indecopi-checklist.md maps every item to a step, a test or what is left to the accredited product.",
  "defaults": {
    "engine": "both",
    "format": "pades",
    "crossValidate": true,
    "options": {
      "common": {
        "level": "BB",
        "credentialId": "sandbox:rsa-2048",
        "signingPolicyId": "preset:signing:iofe",
        "signingControls": {
          "trust": [
            "SandboxRoot"
          ]
        },
        "attemptRefused": true,
        "validation": {
          "trust": [
            "Sandbox"
          ],
          "policyId": "preset:validation:iofe"
        }
      },
      "pades": {
        "documentId": "sample:contract"
      }
    }
  },
  "sections": [
    {
      "id": "tsl",
      "title": "Trusted list (TSL)",
      "description": "The trust anchors come from the Sandbox's list laid out as INDECOPI's (/tl/iofe.xml: TS 102 231 v3, TSLType generic, status undersupervision, TSAs and signature software typed unspecified), read as IofeExtension reads Peru's; its signature is checked against the operator's certificate.",
      "steps": [
        {
          "id": "tsl-ok",
          "title": "Sign with a root listed in the TSL",
          "tags": [
            "F-1",
            "F-3",
            "tsl"
          ],
          "format": "pades",
          "options": {
            "signingControls": {
              "trust": [
                "SandboxIofeList"
              ]
            }
          },
          "expect": {
            "outcome": "signed"
          },
          "description": "The Sandbox's TSL is downloaded, its signature is checked with the operator's certificate, and the signer's root is listed: the signature is made."
        },
        {
          "id": "tsl-wrong-signer",
          "title": "TSL signed by another key: refused",
          "tags": [
            "F-1",
            "tsl"
          ],
          "format": "pades",
          "options": {
            "signingControls": {
              "trust": [
                "SandboxIofeList"
              ]
            }
          },
          "expect": {
            "outcome": "refused",
            "reason": "UntrustedRoot"
          },
          "description": "The Sandbox publishes a TSL signed by a key that is not the operator's (a fake TSL): there are no anchors and the signature is refused.",
          "sandbox": {
            "trustedList": "WrongSigner"
          }
        },
        {
          "id": "tsl-tampered",
          "title": "Tampered TSL: refused",
          "tags": [
            "F-1",
            "tsl"
          ],
          "format": "pades",
          "options": {
            "signingControls": {
              "trust": [
                "SandboxIofeList"
              ]
            }
          },
          "expect": {
            "outcome": "refused",
            "reason": "UntrustedRoot"
          },
          "sandbox": {
            "trustedList": "Tampered"
          }
        },
        {
          "id": "tsl-expired",
          "title": "Expired TSL: refused",
          "tags": [
            "F-2",
            "tsl"
          ],
          "format": "pades",
          "options": {
            "signingControls": {
              "trust": [
                "SandboxIofeList"
              ]
            }
          },
          "expect": {
            "outcome": "refused",
            "reason": "UntrustedRoot"
          },
          "description": "The published TSL has its NextUpdate in the past.",
          "sandbox": {
            "trustedList": "Expired"
          }
        },
        {
          "id": "tsl-tsa-unspecified",
          "title": "Time-stamp from a TSA whose CA the TSL lists as 'unspecified'",
          "tags": [
            "S-1",
            "F-3",
            "tsl",
            "tsa"
          ],
          "format": "pades",
          "options": {
            "level": "BT",
            "timestamp": {
              "provider": "SandboxIofe"
            },
            "signingControls": {
              "trust": [
                "SandboxIofeList"
              ]
            },
            "validation": {
              "trust": [
                "SandboxIofeList"
              ],
              "policyId": "preset:validation:iofe"
            }
          },
          "expect": {
            "outcome": "signed",
            "level": "B-T"
          },
          "description": "As INDECOPI lists the Llama.pe Timestamping CA (not its TSU) with the service type 'unspecified', the TSL names the self-signed CA of the Sandbox's IOFE TSA: its time-stamp chains to that service and the signature is made. Not cross-validated: DSS reads the EU-style list, which does not name that CA.",
          "crossValidate": false
        },
        {
          "id": "tsl-tsa-unlisted",
          "title": "Same TSA without the TSL: refused",
          "tags": [
            "S-1",
            "tsl",
            "tsa"
          ],
          "format": "pades",
          "options": {
            "level": "BT",
            "timestamp": {
              "provider": "SandboxIofe"
            }
          },
          "expect": {
            "outcome": "refused",
            "reason": "TimestampUntrusted"
          },
          "description": "With the Sandbox root as the only anchor, the IOFE TSA chains to nothing trusted: the 'unspecified' service is what makes it trusted.",
          "crossValidate": false
        },
        {
          "id": "v-tsl-ok",
          "kind": "validate",
          "title": "Validate with anchors from the TSL",
          "tags": [
            "V-1",
            "V-3",
            "tsl"
          ],
          "options": {
            "fileId": "step:tsl-ok",
            "settings": {
              "trust": [
                "SandboxIofeList"
              ],
              "policyId": "preset:validation:iofe"
            }
          },
          "expect": {
            "outcome": "valid"
          }
        },
        {
          "id": "v-tsl-wrong-signer",
          "kind": "validate",
          "title": "Validate with a fake TSL",
          "tags": [
            "V-1",
            "tsl"
          ],
          "options": {
            "fileId": "step:tsl-ok",
            "settings": {
              "trust": [
                "SandboxIofeList"
              ],
              "policyId": "preset:validation:iofe"
            }
          },
          "expect": {
            "outcome": "indeterminate",
            "subIndication": "NO_CERTIFICATE_CHAIN_FOUND"
          },
          "sandbox": {
            "trustedList": "WrongSigner"
          }
        },
        {
          "id": "v-tsl-expired",
          "kind": "validate",
          "title": "Validate with an expired TSL",
          "tags": [
            "V-2",
            "tsl"
          ],
          "options": {
            "fileId": "step:tsl-ok",
            "settings": {
              "trust": [
                "SandboxIofeList"
              ],
              "policyId": "preset:validation:iofe"
            }
          },
          "expect": {
            "outcome": "indeterminate",
            "subIndication": "TRY_LATER"
          },
          "sandbox": {
            "trustedList": "Expired"
          }
        },
        {
          "id": "v-tsl-tsa-unspecified",
          "kind": "validate",
          "title": "Validate a time-stamp whose TSA's CA the TSL lists as 'unspecified'",
          "tags": [
            "V-3",
            "S-1",
            "tsl",
            "tsa"
          ],
          "options": {
            "fileId": "step:tsl-tsa-unspecified",
            "settings": {
              "trust": [
                "SandboxIofeList"
              ],
              "policyId": "preset:validation:iofe"
            }
          },
          "expect": {
            "outcome": "valid"
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "revocation",
      "title": "Revocation before signing (CRL and OCSP)",
      "steps": [
        {
          "id": "crl-https-good",
          "title": "CRL over HTTPS, good certificate",
          "tags": [
            "F-5",
            "F-8",
            "crl"
          ],
          "format": "pades",
          "options": {
            "credentialId": "sandbox:good-crl-https"
          },
          "expect": {
            "outcome": "signed"
          }
        },
        {
          "id": "crl-https-revoked",
          "title": "CRL over HTTPS, revoked certificate: refused",
          "tags": [
            "F-5",
            "F-8",
            "crl"
          ],
          "format": "pades",
          "options": {
            "credentialId": "sandbox:revoked-crl-https"
          },
          "expect": {
            "outcome": "refused",
            "reason": "CertificateRevoked"
          }
        },
        {
          "id": "crl-ldap-good",
          "title": "CRL over LDAP, good certificate",
          "tags": [
            "F-5",
            "crl",
            "ldap"
          ],
          "format": "pades",
          "options": {
            "credentialId": "sandbox:good-crl-ldap"
          },
          "expect": {
            "outcome": "signed"
          }
        },
        {
          "id": "crl-ldap-revoked",
          "title": "CRL over LDAP, revoked certificate: refused",
          "tags": [
            "F-5",
            "crl",
            "ldap"
          ],
          "format": "pades",
          "options": {
            "credentialId": "sandbox:revoked-crl-ldap"
          },
          "expect": {
            "outcome": "refused",
            "reason": "CertificateRevoked"
          }
        },
        {
          "id": "crl-wrong-key",
          "title": "CRL signed by another key: refused",
          "tags": [
            "F-6",
            "crl"
          ],
          "format": "pades",
          "options": {
            "credentialId": "sandbox:good-crl-https"
          },
          "expect": {
            "outcome": "refused",
            "reason": "RevocationStatusUnknown"
          },
          "description": "The Sandbox signs the CRL with a key that is not the issuing CA's: the CRL is not accepted and, without OCSP, the status is unknown.",
          "sandbox": {
            "crl": "WrongKey"
          }
        },
        {
          "id": "crl-expired",
          "title": "Expired CRL: refused",
          "tags": [
            "F-7",
            "crl"
          ],
          "format": "pades",
          "options": {
            "credentialId": "sandbox:good-crl-https"
          },
          "expect": {
            "outcome": "refused",
            "reason": "RevocationStatusUnknown"
          },
          "sandbox": {
            "crl": "Expired"
          }
        },
        {
          "id": "crl-no-next-update",
          "title": "CRL without nextUpdate: refused",
          "tags": [
            "F-7",
            "crl"
          ],
          "format": "pades",
          "options": {
            "credentialId": "sandbox:good-crl-https"
          },
          "expect": {
            "outcome": "refused",
            "reason": "RevocationStatusUnknown"
          },
          "description": "A CRL without nextUpdate does not say until when it is current: the IOFE policy (CRLNextUpdatePresent) refuses it.",
          "sandbox": {
            "crl": "NoNextUpdate"
          }
        },
        {
          "id": "crl-stale",
          "title": "Revoked after the cached CRL: refused",
          "tags": [
            "F-8",
            "crl"
          ],
          "format": "pades",
          "options": {
            "credentialId": "sandbox:rsa-3072"
          },
          "expect": {
            "outcome": "refused",
            "reason": "CertificateRevoked"
          },
          "description": "The certificate is revoked now; before signing the status is fetched again (OCSP, then the CRL downloaded without cache), not the earlier copy.",
          "sandbox": {
            "crl": "Stale",
            "revoke": [
              "rsa-3072"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "id": "crl-down",
          "title": "CRL server down, no OCSP: refused",
          "tags": [
            "F-8",
            "crl"
          ],
          "format": "pades",
          "options": {
            "credentialId": "sandbox:good-crl-https"
          },
          "expect": {
            "outcome": "refused",
            "reason": "RevocationStatusUnknown"
          },
          "sandbox": {
            "crl": "Down"
          }
        },
        {
          "id": "v-crl-wrong-key",
          "kind": "validate",
          "title": "Validate with a CRL signed by another key",
          "tags": [
            "V-6",
            "crl"
          ],
          "options": {
            "fileId": "step:crl-https-good",
            "settings": {
              "trust": [
                "Sandbox"
              ],
              "policyId": "preset:validation:iofe"
            }
          },
          "expect": {
            "outcome": "indeterminate"
          },
          "sandbox": {
            "crl": "WrongKey"
          }
        },
        {
          "id": "v-crl-expired",
          "kind": "validate",
          "title": "Validate with an expired CRL",
          "tags": [
            "V-7",
            "crl"
          ],
          "options": {
            "fileId": "step:crl-https-good",
            "settings": {
              "trust": [
                "Sandbox"
              ],
              "policyId": "preset:validation:iofe"
            }
          },
          "expect": {
            "outcome": "indeterminate"
          },
          "sandbox": {
            "crl": "Expired"
          }
        },
        {
          "id": "chain-revoked",
          "title": "Certificate under a revoked CA: refused",
          "tags": [
            "F-9",
            "revocation"
          ],
          "format": "pades",
          "options": {
            "credentialId": "sandbox:under-revoked-ca"
          },
          "expect": {
            "outcome": "refused",
            "reason": "CertificateRevoked"
          }
        },
        {
          "id": "ocsp-good",
          "title": "OCSP, good certificate",
          "tags": [
            "F-10",
            "ocsp"
          ],
          "format": "pades",
          "options": {
            "credentialId": "sandbox:good-ocsp"
          },
          "expect": {
            "outcome": "signed"
          }
        },
        {
          "id": "ocsp-revoked",
          "title": "OCSP, revoked certificate: refused",
          "tags": [
            "F-10",
            "ocsp"
          ],
          "format": "pades",
          "options": {
            "credentialId": "sandbox:revoked-ocsp"
          },
          "expect": {
            "outcome": "refused",
            "reason": "CertificateRevoked"
          }
        },
        {
          "id": "ocsp-unauthorized",
          "title": "OCSP response from an unauthorized signer, no CRL: refused",
          "tags": [
            "F-10",
            "ocsp"
          ],
          "format": "pades",
          "options": {
            "credentialId": "sandbox:good-ocsp"
          },
          "expect": {
            "outcome": "refused",
            "reason": "RevocationStatusUnknown"
          },
          "sandbox": {
            "ocsp": "Unauthorized"
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "validity",
      "title": "Certificate validity and purpose",
      "steps": [
        {
          "id": "expired",
          "title": "Expired certificate: refused",
          "tags": [
            "F-11",
            "validity"
          ],
          "format": "pades",
          "options": {
            "credentialId": "sandbox:expired"
          },
          "expect": {
            "outcome": "refused",
            "reason": "CertificateExpired"
          }
        },
        {
          "id": "not-yet-valid",
          "title": "Not yet valid certificate: refused",
          "tags": [
            "F-11",
            "validity"
          ],
          "format": "pades",
          "options": {
            "credentialId": "sandbox:not-yet-valid"
          },
          "expect": {
            "outcome": "refused",
            "reason": "CertificateNotCurrentlyValid"
          }
        },
        {
          "id": "chain-expired",
          "title": "Certificate under an expired CA: refused",
          "tags": [
            "F-11",
            "validity"
          ],
          "format": "pades",
          "options": {
            "credentialId": "sandbox:under-expired-ca"
          },
          "expect": {
            "outcome": "refused",
            "reason": "ChainCertificateNotValid"
          }
        },
        {
          "id": "no-key-usage",
          "title": "Neither digitalSignature nor nonRepudiation: refused",
          "tags": [
            "F-12",
            "key-usage"
          ],
          "format": "pades",
          "options": {
            "credentialId": "sandbox:no-signing-key-usage"
          },
          "expect": {
            "outcome": "refused",
            "reason": "KeyUsageNotPermitted"
          }
        },
        {
          "id": "no-key-usage-extension",
          "title": "No KeyUsage extension: refused",
          "tags": [
            "F-12",
            "key-usage"
          ],
          "format": "pades",
          "options": {
            "credentialId": "sandbox:no-key-usage-extension"
          },
          "expect": {
            "outcome": "refused",
            "reason": "KeyUsageNotPermitted"
          }
        },
        {
          "id": "no-key-usage-cades",
          "title": "CADES: neither digitalSignature nor nonRepudiation",
          "tags": [
            "F-12",
            "key-usage"
          ],
          "format": "cades",
          "options": {
            "dataId": "cades-sample:text",
            "credentialId": "sandbox:no-signing-key-usage"
          },
          "expect": {
            "outcome": "refused",
            "reason": "KeyUsageNotPermitted"
          }
        },
        {
          "id": "no-key-usage-xades",
          "title": "XADES: neither digitalSignature nor nonRepudiation",
          "tags": [
            "F-12",
            "key-usage"
          ],
          "format": "xades",
          "options": {
            "dataId": "xades-sample:order",
            "credentialId": "sandbox:no-signing-key-usage"
          },
          "expect": {
            "outcome": "refused",
            "reason": "KeyUsageNotPermitted"
          }
        },
        {
          "id": "signed-no-nonrepudiation",
          "title": "Sign with a certificate without nonRepudiation (to validate)",
          "tags": [
            "F-12",
            "key-usage"
          ],
          "format": "pades",
          "options": {
            "credentialId": "sandbox:no-nonrepudiation"
          },
          "expect": {
            "outcome": "signed"
          },
          "description": "The iofe signing policy accepts digitalSignature or nonRepudiation (as section 4.1 does for end-user software); the file is used by the validation step that requires nonRepudiation."
        },
        {
          "id": "no-nonrepudiation-agent",
          "title": "Automated agent: a certificate without nonRepudiation is refused",
          "tags": [
            "F-12",
            "key-usage"
          ],
          "format": "pades",
          "options": {
            "credentialId": "sandbox:no-nonrepudiation",
            "signingPolicyId": "preset:signing:iofe-nonrepudiation"
          },
          "expect": {
            "outcome": "refused",
            "reason": "KeyUsageNotPermitted"
          },
          "description": "Section 4.2 (annex B item 12) asks an automated agent to check the nonRepudiation bit: the iofe-nonrepudiation policy refuses a certificate that has digitalSignature only."
        },
        {
          "id": "v-no-nonrepudiation",
          "kind": "validate",
          "title": "Validation requires nonRepudiation: not accepted",
          "tags": [
            "V-12",
            "key-usage"
          ],
          "options": {
            "fileId": "step:signed-no-nonrepudiation",
            "settings": {
              "trust": [
                "Sandbox"
              ],
              "policyId": "preset:validation:iofe-nonrepudiation"
            }
          },
          "expect": {
            "outcome": "indeterminate"
          },
          "description": "With the iofe-nonrepudiation policy the certificate without nonRepudiation fails the chain constraint (EN 319 102-1: INDETERMINATE)."
        },
        {
          "id": "v-revoked",
          "kind": "validate",
          "title": "Validate a revoked signer",
          "tags": [
            "V-5",
            "V-8",
            "V-9",
            "V-10",
            "revocation"
          ],
          "options": {
            "fileId": "sample:revoked",
            "settings": {
              "trust": [
                "Sandbox"
              ],
              "policyId": "preset:validation:iofe"
            }
          },
          "expect": {
            "outcome": "indeterminate"
          },
          "description": "A sample signed by a certificate revoked afterwards: the validator checks the chain's CRL/OCSP and does not accept it."
        },
        {
          "id": "v-expired",
          "kind": "validate",
          "title": "Validate an expired signer",
          "tags": [
            "V-11",
            "validity"
          ],
          "options": {
            "fileId": "sample:expired",
            "settings": {
              "trust": [
                "Sandbox"
              ],
              "policyId": "preset:validation:iofe"
            }
          },
          "expect": {
            "outcome": "indeterminate"
          }
        },
        {
          "id": "v-untrusted",
          "kind": "validate",
          "title": "Validate with a root outside the anchors",
          "tags": [
            "V-3",
            "trust"
          ],
          "options": {
            "fileId": "sample:untrusted-root",
            "settings": {
              "trust": [
                "Sandbox"
              ],
              "policyId": "preset:validation:iofe"
            }
          },
          "expect": {
            "outcome": "indeterminate"
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "timestamp",
      "title": "Time-stamps (RFC 3161)",
      "description": "Each time-stamp obtained while signing is checked: expected TSA, token signature, trust, validity and revocation of the TSA certificate.",
      "steps": [
        {
          "id": "tsa-ok",
          "title": "Time-stamp from the Sandbox's TSA",
          "tags": [
            "S-1",
            "S-2",
            "S-3",
            "S-4",
            "F-31",
            "tsa"
          ],
          "format": "pades",
          "options": {
            "level": "BT",
            "timestamp": {
              "provider": "Sandbox"
            },
            "signingControls": {
              "trust": [
                "SandboxRoot"
              ],
              "expectedTsa": "tsa"
            }
          },
          "expect": {
            "outcome": "signed",
            "level": "B-T"
          }
        },
        {
          "id": "tsa-unexpected",
          "title": "Time-stamp from another TSA than expected: refused",
          "tags": [
            "S-1",
            "tsa"
          ],
          "format": "pades",
          "options": {
            "level": "BT",
            "timestamp": {
              "provider": "Sandbox"
            },
            "signingControls": {
              "trust": [
                "SandboxRoot"
              ],
              "expectedTsa": "tsa-revoked"
            }
          },
          "expect": {
            "outcome": "refused",
            "reason": "TimestampUntrusted"
          }
        },
        {
          "id": "tsa-invalid-token",
          "title": "Token with an invalid signature: refused",
          "tags": [
            "S-2",
            "tsa"
          ],
          "format": "pades",
          "options": {
            "level": "BT",
            "timestamp": {
              "provider": "Sandbox"
            }
          },
          "expect": {
            "outcome": "refused"
          },
          "sandbox": {
            "tsa": "InvalidToken"
          }
        },
        {
          "id": "tsa-revoked",
          "title": "Revoked TSA: refused",
          "tags": [
            "S-3",
            "tsa"
          ],
          "format": "pades",
